      5 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تطّرس</span></b>  <i>He ate not, nor drank, aught save
what was good;</i> (K, TA;) like <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تنطّس</span>: so says
IF. (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تطرّس عَنْهُ</span> <i>He shunned it; kept
aloof,</i> or <i>preserved himself, from it;</i> (Sgh, K,
TA;) and <i>held himself above the commission of it.</i>
(Sgh, TA.)

